# Internal retrospective documents (root-cause analyses for release defects).
# These reference local paths and design rationale; they are local-only and
# MUST NOT be committed alongside the public v0.8.x changelog entries. The
# corresponding high-level ISSUE entries are summarized in CHANGELOG.md.
doc/

# Generated example outputs (runtime logs, transcripts, screenshots)
temp/examples/

